<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Santa Fe at $28-1/2, above range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Santa Fe at $28-1/2, above range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name    Santa Fe International Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At			   $28-1/2</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	 $24-$27</p>
<p>   Number of Shares	   35.0 million</p>
<p>   Underwriters	 Goldman Sachs &amp; Co</p>
<p>   Description   offshore and land contract driller</p>
<p>NOTE: The company is being spun off from parent company Kuwait Petroleum Corp.</p>
<p>According to lead underwriter Goldman Sachs, the company raised the offering to 35 million shares from 30 million.</p>
<p>Twenty eight million shares are being sold in the United States. Seven million shares are being sold internationally.</p>
</text>
